[0.501165, "o", "\r\n   \u001b[1m\u001b[36mKEOS SRE AGENT\u001b[0m\r\n   \u001b[1mEpisode 0 · The install wizard\u001b[0m\r\n   \u001b[2mgit clone → keosctl install · 6 steps, zero docs needed\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
